## ⚠️ Medical Disclaimer

This application is an **educational Machine Learning project**.

The predictions generated by this application should **not be considered medical advice or a diagnosis**. Machine Learning predictions can contain errors and should not be used to make healthcare decisions.

If you have concerns about diabetes or your health, consult a qualified healthcare professional.

